# Payments (Stripe)

## Prefer existing layers

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| Publishable key | `src/config/stripe.js` (follows `API_ENV`) |
| Provider | `StripeAppBridge` + `PaymentStripeContext` |
| API façade | `src/services/payment/` |
| State | `paymentSlice` |

## Env

- Production vs UAT keys via `API_ENV` and `STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY_*` in `.env`
- Optional local intents: `npm run stripe-server` + `STRIPE_PAYMENT_BACKEND_URL`

## Do

- Gate payment/cart screens for guests (`GUEST_RESTRICTED_SCREENS` / `requireAuth`)
- Reuse payment contracts in `src/services/payment/contracts.js`

## Do not

- Hardcode secret keys or live publishable keys in source
- Bypass `StripeAppBridge` / invent a second Stripe provider
- Call Stripe REST from screens without going through the payment service + backend intents
